[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="CasChapterSceneVisual" load_steps=25 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_scene_resource.gd" id="1_scene"]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_line_resource.gd" id="2_line"]

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_0"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="两份证词放到一张桌上时，看起来比想象中更不一致。上午的人记得干净鞋套，下午的人记得箱子空着；账本上的时间又比她们说的各差一段。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_1"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我们是不是得问到她们说法一样，才算核对完成？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_2"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="不用。那可能只是问到她们开始猜我们想听什么。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_3"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="她让你遮住两份笔录的结论，只保留每个人真的见过的东西。鞋套、封签、箱子的重量、谁拿过钥匙。把说法拆开以后，矛盾少了，空白却多起来。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_4"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="这样拿去，她们会不会觉得我们什么都没查到？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_5"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="觉得也没办法。比交一份整齐的错话好。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_6"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="我刚才也差点给看守提词。我说“是不是戴白手套的人”，她想了一会儿，差点就点头了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_7"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="真的不是？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_8"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="不知道。就是不知道才不该替她先说。以后你听见我这样问，拽一下我的袖子。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_9"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你把那句带答案的问题划出去，旁边写明为什么删。原来不是只有证人才会记错，做记录的人也会把自己希望看见的东西挤进去。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_10"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="我们还缺一件事：那只空箱和后来装档案的箱是不是同一只。拉姆森看过铰链，让她来认，不拿证词替实物。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_11"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="左铰链换过，螺丝不是原配。这只也是。能说同一类修理习惯，不能说同一个箱子，港里会这么修的人不少。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_12"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="连这个也不能确定。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_13"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="确定的够用了。封签后加过，接口被改过，原记录缺页。这三件事互相独立，谁想反驳就一件件反驳，别让他一句“人会记错”全抹掉。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_14"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你重新排了次页码，没有把空白剪掉。德雷顿把两位证人的保管条件写在后面：原账需归还，不在公开广播里报她们的住址，新增询问先征求本人同意。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_15"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="这几条也要给旧金山看？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_16"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="尤其给她看。位子越高，越容易以为别人提供一份线索，就顺便答应了所有后来会发生的事。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_17"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="临近交班，电灯闪了一下。你下意识按住录音装置，帕金斯把备用电池推过来，没有催你恢复。她说记录断了就标断了，别拿记忆补回那几秒。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_18"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="你为什么这么在意这些？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_19"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="因为我听过一份很完整的报告。里面每句话都像是真的，连起来却把还活着的人写没了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_20"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="她没有说那个人是谁。你等了一会儿，见她把笔盖扣好，手仍停在账本上，便没有继续问。德雷顿也没接话，只将一杯水放到她手边。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_21"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="好了，先送报告，再领晚饭。今天谁敢说“顺手查完再吃”，我就把他的铅笔藏起来。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

